flowchart TD
    A([Wake-up: RTC timer or button]) --> B[Restore state from RTC memory]
    B --> C{WiFi + MQTT within 8 s?}
    C -- yes --> D[Mark new firmware valid if pending OTA verify]
    C -- no --> E[Offline mode: local control only]
    D --> F[Start FreeRTOS tasks: sensor, control, display, net]
    E --> F
    F --> G[sensor task: sample soil, light, battery, BME280, float switch]
    G --> H[control task: irrigation state machine]
    H --> I{Tank empty or probe fault?}
    I -- yes --> J[Pump OFF, lockout, report] --> P
    I -- no --> K{Soil below 35 % and budget left?}
    K -- no --> P
    K -- yes --> L{Midday heat and soil not critical?}
    L -- yes --> P[Decide sleep time 5 min - 2 h]
    L -- no --> M[Pump ON - stay awake, sample every 2 s]
    M --> N{Soil above 60 %, 300 s reached or budget used?}
    N -- no --> M
    N -- yes --> O[Pump OFF, rest 30 min] --> P
    P --> Q[net task publishes final status]
    Q --> R([Deep sleep, wake on timer or button])
